DATA NOTICE: kmeans

Data files tracked by DVC in this directory (fetch with `dvc pull`):
  kdd_cup.tar.bz -> kdd_cup

What:
  494,020 network-connection records, each a row number followed by 34
  numeric features, used as k-means input.

Attribution:
  KDD Cup 1999 Data, Salvatore Stolfo, Wei Fan, Wenke Lee, Andreas
  Prodromidis and Philip Chan, UCI Machine Learning Repository,
  https://doi.org/10.24432/C51C7N, licensed under CC BY 4.0.
  Processed for the Rodinia benchmark suite (University of Virginia):
  S. Che et al., "Rodinia: A Benchmark Suite for Heterogeneous
  Computing", IISWC 2009.

Changes:
  Modified by Rodinia: derived from the 10% training set (494,021
  records; 494,020 are present). Of the 41 original features, 34
  numeric ones are kept (the 3 symbolic features, the connection label
  and 4 further columns are not present), and a row number was added.
  HeCBench uses Rodinia's file unchanged.

